<h2>Piranti Musik Jogèd Remo</h2>
Piranti Musik Jogèd Remo.
Jogèd Remo punika iringanipun ngagem &lt;a href="gamelan"&gt;gamelan&lt;/a&gt; kawujud &lt;a href="bonang"&gt;bonang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="saron"&gt;saron&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="gambang"&gt;gambang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="gender"&gt;gender&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="slentem"&gt;slentem&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="siter"&gt;siter&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="seruling"&gt;seruling&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="ketuk"&gt;ketuk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kenong"&gt;kenong&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kempul"&gt;kempul&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="gong"&gt;gong&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="irama"&gt;irama&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="slendro"&gt;slendro&lt;/a&gt;. Gendinganipun ngagem gendingan jula-juli Suroboyo tropongan, padatanipun ngagem walang kekek,gedong rancak, krucilan kaliyan sanèsipun.
<h2>Tata Wusana Jogèd Remo</h2>
Tata Wusana Jogèd Remo.
Ageman jogèd remo punika warni-warni gaya, inggih punika:
<ul>
<li>Surabayaan</li>
<li>Malangan</li>
<li>Sawunggalingan</li>
