<doc id="91799" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=91799" title="Buda Gotama ing Hindhu">
Buda Gotama ing Hindhu

Ana ing &lt;a href="agama"&gt;agama&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Hindhu"&gt;Hindhu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Buda%20Gotama"&gt;Buda Gotama&lt;/a&gt; kacantum ana ing kitab &lt;a href="Purana"&gt;Purana&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Susastra"&gt;Susastra&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Hindhu"&gt;Hindhu&lt;/a&gt;) minangka &lt;a href="awatara"&gt;awatara&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="inkarnasi"&gt;inkarnasi&lt;/a&gt;) kasanga ing antarané sepuluh &lt;a href="awatara"&gt;awatara&lt;/a&gt; (Dasawatara) Déwa &lt;a href="Wisnu"&gt;Wisnu&lt;/a&gt;. Ana ing &lt;a href="Bhagawatapurana"&gt;Bhagawatapurana&lt;/a&gt;, Buda sinebut &lt;a href="awatara"&gt;awatara&lt;/a&gt; kang angka patlikur ing antarané selawe &lt;a href="awatara"&gt;awatara&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Wisnu"&gt;Wisnu&lt;/a&gt;. Tembung buddha ateges "Beliau kang olèh pancerahan" lan bisa pinuju marang &lt;a href="Buda"&gt;Buda&lt;/a&gt; saliyané kajaba &lt;a href="Buda%20Gotama"&gt;Buda Gotama&lt;/a&gt;, kang yasa &lt;a href="Buda"&gt;Buda&lt;/a&gt; kang kawentar nganti jaman saiki.
Benten kaliyan ajaran &lt;a href="hindu"&gt;hindu&lt;/a&gt;, ajaran &lt;a href="Buda%20Gotama"&gt;Buda Gotama&lt;/a&gt; boten nekenaken kawontenan “Tuhan sang Pencipta”, saéngga &lt;a href="agama"&gt;agama&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Buda"&gt;Buda&lt;/a&gt; kalebet péranganing salah satunggaling aliran &lt;a href="n%C4%81stika"&gt;nāstika&lt;/a&gt; (heterodoks: kanthi barès ateges “punika boten wonten”) miturut aliran-aliran agama Dharma sanèsipun, kados ta Dwaita, nanging wonten ing sanèsipun kados ta, Adwaita, langkung mirib kaliyan ajaran Buda, saking wujud menapa déné filsafatipun.
<h2>Buda wonten ing Sastra Hindhu</h2>
Buda wonten ing Sastra Hindhu.
Sang Buda kasebutaken wonten ing manéka &lt;a href="kitab"&gt;kitab&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Hindhu"&gt;Hindhu&lt;/a&gt;, kalebet ing kathah &lt;a href="Purana"&gt;Purana&lt;/a&gt;. Nanging, boten sadayanipun ngacu dhumateng tiyang &lt;a href="Buda"&gt;Buda&lt;/a&gt; ingkang sami, ngengeti bilih &lt;a href="Buda"&gt;Buda&lt;/a&gt; boten naming satunggal; manéka ing salebeting ngacu dhumateng tiyang sanès, saha panyebutan tembung &lt;a href="Buda"&gt;Buda&lt;/a&gt; ateges “sawijining tiyang ingkangga gadhah &lt;a href="buddhi"&gt;buddhi&lt;/a&gt;.” Kathahipun saking pangginanaan tembung &lt;a href="buddha"&gt;buddha&lt;/a&gt; mau ngacu dhumateng pambangun Buda (&lt;a href="Sidharta%20Gotama"&gt;Sidharta Gotama&lt;/a&gt;). &lt;a href="Purana"&gt;Purana&lt;/a&gt; mendeskripsikakenipun kanthi kalih peran: menyebarken ajaran palsu saperlu nyesataken kaum asura (makluk sesat, panentang déwa) saha sajinisipun, saha ngritik pangorbanan kéwan kados ta ingkang sampun katemtokaken wonten ing &lt;a href="Weda"&gt;Weda&lt;/a&gt;. Kitab &lt;a href="Purana"&gt;Purana&lt;/a&gt; ingkang nyebataken &lt;a href="Buda"&gt;Buda&lt;/a&gt; kalebet ing pratélan &lt;a href="Awatara"&gt;Awatara&lt;/a&gt;, inggih punika:
