Gasherbrum III basa Urdu: گاشر برم-3, Cina disederhanakan: 加舒尔布鲁木III峰; tradhisional Cina: 加舒尔布鲁木III峰, pinyin: Jiāshūěrbùlǔmù III fen. Gunung punika minangka pepanggihan antawisipun pucuking &lt;a href="Gasherbrum%20massif"&gt;Gasherbrum massif&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="Baltoro%20Muztagh"&gt;Baltoro Muztagh&lt;/a&gt;, subrange saking &lt;a href="karakoram"&gt;karakoram&lt;/a&gt; wonten ing watesan antawisipun tlatah sisih lèr &lt;a href="Pakistan"&gt;Pakistan&lt;/a&gt; kaliyan &lt;a href="Xianjiang"&gt;Xianjiang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Cina"&gt;Cina&lt;/a&gt; wonten ing tlatah &lt;a href="Baltistan"&gt;Baltistan&lt;/a&gt;. Gasherbrum III papanipun manggèn wonten ing antawisipun &lt;a href="Gasherbrum%20II"&gt;Gasherbrum II&lt;/a&gt; kaliyan &lt;a href="Gasherbrum%20IV"&gt;Gasherbrum IV&lt;/a&gt;.
Gasherbrum III saged dipunanggep dados subpeak saking Gasherbrum II. Amargi boten saged nglangkungi saking 500 mèter topografi cutoff gunung independen.
Gasherbrum III minangka salah satunggaling pucuk ingkang paling tinggi dipunminggahi kaliyan kaping pisan nalika taun 1975, dipunminggahi déning &lt;a href="Wanda%20Rutkiewicz"&gt;Wanda Rutkiewicz&lt;/a&gt;, Alison Chadwick-Onyszkiewicz, &lt;a href="Janusz%20Onyszkiewicz"&gt;Janusz Onyszkiewicz&lt;/a&gt; kaliyan Krzysztof Zdzitowiecki, anggota èkspèdhisi &lt;a href="Polen"&gt;Polen&lt;/a&gt;.
Gasherbrum IV, trekadang ugi dipunsebat minangka puncak ingkang paling éndah wonten ing &lt;a href="karakoram"&gt;karakoram&lt;/a&gt;. Gunung punika inggilipun 26089&amp;nbsp;ft / 7952 m.
