<h4>Surfakatan</h4>
Surfakatan.
Surfaktan yaiku zat aktif sing duwèni pucuk sing béda yaiku hidrofil (seneng banyu) lan hidrofob (seneng lemak). Surfaktan fungsiné ana gayutané karo sudut kontak sistem pencucian. Surfaktan ana 4 kategori, kaya ta:
<ul>
<li>Anionik:</li>
</ul>
<ol>
<li>Alkyl Benzene Sulfonate (ABS)</<li>
<li>Linier Alkyl Benzene Sulfonate (LAS)</<li>
<li>Alpha Olein Sulfonate (AOS)</<li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li>Kationik: Garam Ammonium</li>
<li>Non ionik: Nonyl phenol polyethoxyle</li>
<li>Amphoterik: Acyl Ethylenediamines</li>
