<doc id="92105" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=92105" title="Lawa (Ramayana)">
Lawa (Ramayana)

Lawa (&lt;a href="basa%20Sansekerta"&gt;basa Sansekerta&lt;/a&gt;: लव berarti "partikel", &lt;a href="Tamil"&gt;Tamil&lt;/a&gt;: இலவன், &lt;a href="Melayu"&gt;Melayu&lt;/a&gt;: Tilawi, &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;: Lawa, &lt;a href="Khmer"&gt;Khmer&lt;/a&gt;: Jupalaks, &lt;a href="Lao"&gt;Lao&lt;/a&gt;: Phra &lt;a href="Laos"&gt;Laos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Thailand"&gt;Thailand&lt;/a&gt;: Phra Lop, &lt;a href="Telugu"&gt;Telugu&lt;/a&gt;: లవుడు) inggih punika putranipun &lt;a href="Rama"&gt;Rama&lt;/a&gt; kaliyan &lt;a href="Sita"&gt;Sita&lt;/a&gt;, wonten salebeting &lt;a href="wiracarita"&gt;wiracarita&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Ramayana"&gt;Ramayana&lt;/a&gt;. Lawa gadhah sadulur kembar, ingkang asma &lt;a href="Kusa"&gt;Kusa&lt;/a&gt;. Lawa kaliyan Kusa lair sasampunipun Sita dipunbucal wonten saktengahing utan déning Rama. Wonten ing wekdal punika, Sita saweg hamil tual. Lajeng Sita maanggen wonten griyanipun &lt;a href="Walmiki"&gt;Walmiki&lt;/a&gt;. Wonten panggènan punika, lairipun Lawa kaliyan Kusa.

